One script drives the baseline installation and must be green before every release. It covers:

- create, prompt, steer and interrupt;
- checkpoint mid-turn (R-04);
- sleep and resume;
- busy and idle hard caps at 5 minutes, for Pi, Codex and Claude;
- vaporize, then absence from the list (R-02);
- the credential sink scan (R-09).

Every R card adds its proof here.

